# 7) Speaker-labeled SRT (re-engineer plan)
Your MVP records **only local mic**, so Speaker 1/2 is trivial but not true “both sides”.

To get *real* Speaker 1/2:

### Best production route (recommended)
- Each phone uploads its own audio
- Server merges + runs diarization + outputs:
  - `speaker_srt.srt`
  - `minutes.docx`
  - `action_items.csv`

I can give you that server-side merge next (ffmpeg + pyannote + whisper) once you confirm MVP call works.

---

# 8) Re-engineer after it works (what we’ll improve)
Once MVP runs, we upgrade to:
- ✅ Background upload (no UI waiting)
- ✅ Continuous chunk upload during call (near-real-time transcription)
- ✅ Merge both sides + diarization → **Speaker 1/2**
- ✅ Export pack: DOCX minutes + SRT + action items
- ✅ Offline-only mode (local whisper on PC, no cloud)

